    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95390.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Free Thought Radio is the weekly production of the Freedom from Religion Foundation, and we have those two purposes. We always announce to keep religion out of government and to promote the use of reason and social policy by representing the views of those of us who are personally not religious. And we'd love to have you join us at the start of our new year at FFRF.org.",
