    "turn_text": "Today we have a very special guest, U.S. Representative Jared Huffman will join us in a few minutes on the phone from Washington DC. He is one of the co-founders of the Congressional Free Thought Caucus in the U.S. House of Representatives. Congressman Huffman will tell us what it was like during the January 6th insurrection at the National Capitol.",
