    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "This is democracy's day, a day of history and hope. The will of the people has been heard and the will of the people has been heeded. We've learned again that democracy is precious. Democracy is fragile. And at this hour, my friends, democracy has prevailed.",
