    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "And I feel good about the fact that of the 17 executive orders issued yesterday by our new president, they included getting rid of the Muslim ban. They included signing up again for the Paris climate accord. No more wall at our border. I am feeling good that I think the Biden administration will honor the anniversary of Roe v. Wade, which is Friday, January 22nd, by hopefully soon repealing the global gag rule that we have a lot of more executive orders coming, but a lot of legislative work to do.",
