    "turn_text": "They are one of our attorneys. So they're actually a really good coalition effort. So Democracy Forward is co-counsel in the case along with Lambda Legal, which has a great reputation for protecting LGBTQ rights. So they obviously have a concern. And I think they had highlighted that a lot of the people who suffer discrimination are vulnerable populations like LGBTQ persons. So that's the attorneys representing us. And then there are seven groups. We're one of seven groups involved. Some of those are um even um like a Jewish religious group that provides um social services that want these rules to be changed back to the way they were um were involved american atheists involved so you know kind of the organization that um would be um you know either providing services or dealing with the fallout you know people not getting their notices people being discriminated against they think that's certainly something that impacts our organization in terms of dealing with those complaints and we kind of have to carry the burden then to um... get the word out on the rules that you know there's no longer a requirement to to tell people what the rules are uh... that's something that f f r f is planning on undertaking and you know getting the word out about this notice requirement",
