        "text": "Democratic institutions were previously taken for granted by Americans.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The recent events have exposed serious vulnerabilities in the U.S. political system.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Americans should appreciate democratic institutions more after experiencing their threat.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a risk that people will become complacent again once stability returns.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes in the long-term resilience of American democracy despite setbacks.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
