    "turn_text": "Hi, I'm Julia Sweeney and I'm an atheist and former Catholic. I even wrote a play about it called Letting Go of God. Right now Catholic bishops are using their considerable influence to deny women contraceptive rights. Please join the Freedom from Religion Foundation and help keep church and state separate. You can call 1-800-335-4021. That's 1-800-335-4021, or visit ffrf.org to stand up for true religious freedom. Beware of dogma. This is Free Thought Radio. I'm Annie Laurie Gailor.",
